INSERT INTO `TeamMember` VALUES ('cmsfjcehw0013l22kuyvufy14','Taslima Akter','Founder & CEO','Strategic Leadership & International Education','Leading ALO Education\'s mission to make quality global education accessible to Bangladeshi students. With over 18 years in the international education sector, Taslima has helped thousands of students achieve their study abroad dreams.','',1,'active','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524'),('cmsfjcehw0014l22kgujoj5gq','Md. Rafiqul Islam','Head of Admissions','University Admissions & Placement','Over 15 years experience in international student admissions across UK, USA, Canada and Australia. Rafiq has built strong relationships with top universities worldwide.','',2,'active','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524'),('cmsfjcehw0015l22k0yfsu16z','Farzana Rahman','Senior Visa Officer','Student Visa & Immigration','Specialized in UK, Canada and Australia student visa applications with deep immigration knowledge. Farzana maintains a 98% visa approval rate across all applications.','',3,'active','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524'),('cmsfjcehw0016l22krqecx650','Shakib Ahmed','Career Counselor','Career Planning & University Matching','Helping students identify the right career paths and university programs since 2018. Shakib combines data-driven insights with personalized counseling.','',4,'active','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524'),('cmsfjcehw0017l22kut9b3gw8','Nadia Islam','English Test Instructor','IELTS, PTE & English Language Training','Certified IELTS and PTE trainer with 10+ years of teaching experience. Nadia has helped hundreds of students achieve target scores for top university admissions.','',5,'active','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524'),('cmsfjcehw0018l22ki3viqcn2','Tanvir Hasan','Application Officer','Application Processing & Documentation','Managing end-to-end application processes for 500+ students annually. Tanvir ensures every application is complete, accurate, and submitted on time.','',6,'active','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524','2026-08-05 03:36:39.524');
